{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.3, [TSON-SCHEMA] §9"
  description: "A one-position tuple of `text` given its one element. The bracket sugar spells a tuple of two or more positions and `[T]` is an array, so the one-position tuple is declared with `meta.tuple` in its positional form, and a value is written as any tuple is."
  valid: _
}
